{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xZWZS7w0zZ1795016482.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「幻彩詠香江」晚上作告別演出。</p><p></p><p>踏正晚上8時，有22年歷史的「幻彩詠香江」，特別加添煙火元素作為它的告別作。不少市民在尖沙咀海旁，舉機跟它講再見。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIGHT-2300-1_CLEAN_20261118_233212.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gVmuXSso6c1795016507.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有市民就想更近距離見證，登上觀光船。</p><p></p><p>張女士說：「最後一次了，我都是第一次那麼認真看，不夠澎湃、都還算可以。」</p><p></p><p>伍先生說：「我特意買票上來看，氣氛非常好，及在這裡是很接近整個維港。」</p><p></p><p>最後一次上演的「幻彩詠香江」，跟以往一樣歷時10分鐘，有40多幢大廈參加。在這艘船上除了可看匯演，更可與一班親朋好友吃蛇宴，歌手李龍基都是座上客。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIGHT-2300-1_CLEAN_20261118_233212_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cUD6gxohAQ1795016498.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>李龍基說：「今天是蛇羹、好東西來的，希望這個(幻彩詠香江)停了後，有更燦爛的東西給我們。」</p><p></p><p>觀光船營運總監葉定國指，相信單靠維港本身景色，仍能吸引旅客遊覽。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:24:39.511282+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T15:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:37:40.075190+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:17:42.979238+00:00","content_hash":"dfe3ae5b119a269e616e1bebb217a240874c9f22ce584d7569773547b74cb599","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}